id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
19802::$$$message_0156_0000_0000$$$::"Splendid...![lr]::
19803::$$$message_0156_0000_0001$$$::I knew I saw a Professor of Fate Studies in you![lr]::
19804::$$$message_0156_0000_0002$$$::Now, let me reward you for your knowledge of useless trivia."::
19805::$$$message_0156_0001_0000$$$::"Drinks have been replenished at the Emiya residence!"::
19806::$$$message_0156_0001_0001$$$::"That's right. Keep buttering up the girls at home while you have a good time, you pervy kappa.[lr]::
19807::$$$message_0156_0001_0002$$$::See you next time! New challenges await you at the third hour of the ox, when even the plants slumber!"::
19808::$$$message_0156_0002_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
19809::$$$message_0156_0002_0001$$$::The Quiz Fiend vanishes, leaving behind a mysterious item.[lr]::
19810::$$$message_0156_0002_0002$$$::The sky has been covered in red for some time now.[lr]::
19811::$$$message_0156_0002_0003$$$::I don't think it's even been ten minutes, but it was a battle for life and death that felt like thirty minutes compressed into one.::
19812::$$$message_0156_0003_0000$$$::"I don't think we've seen the last of the Quiz Fiend..."[lr]::
19813::$$$message_0156_0003_0001$$$::The fight will go on.[lr]::
19814::$$$message_0156_0003_0002$$$::I chew over my temporary victory and head back to the castle.[lr]::
19815::$$$message_0156_0003_0003$$$::By the way...[lr]::
19816::$$$message_0156_0003_0004$$$::How long do we have to keep dealing with that person?::
919803::$$$message_9156_0000_0001$$$::"I knew I saw a Professor of Fate Studies in you!"::

